# Never copy these into the build context — they are huge, machine-specific,
# or rebuilt inside the image anyway.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
img
*.log
.DS_Store
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore
# NOTE: packages/sdk/test/fixtures is deliberately NOT ignored. The 1.6 MB
# snapshot is what the 73,414-day regression test reads; excluding it made three
# tests fail inside the container while passing on the host. It never reaches the
# runtime image anyway — only apps/web/dist is copied into nginx.
